I solved this by hand from the constraints and checked all 25 against the answer. Elif must be first, since she comes before everyone else. Ann and Dev must be two slots apart, which only works with Ann in slot 2 or 3, and slot 3 leaves no room for Gus and Cara. That forces Ann in slot 2, Dev in slot 4, and the rest follows. This is the only arrangement that satisfies every constraint.
